=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_abeezee\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"TAPE B666: ELSEWHERE\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTg2NTQ4LnBuZw==/original/29CHZf.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">TAPE B666: ELSEWHERE</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_6590609\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable tapeb666 for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://samukagomes.itch.io/tape-b666-elsewhere/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1></h1>\r\n<h1>TAPE B666</h1>\r\n<h4>Every tape tells a different story.</h4>\r\n<p><strong>Tape B666</strong> is a series of short horror experiences inspired by the aesthetic and atmosphere of vintage VHS tapes.\r\n </p>\r\n<p>Each tape presents a different story in a distinct setting, featuring unique characters, situations, and forms of horror. You never know what you will find in the next recording.</p>\r\n<h2><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTg2NTMxLnBuZw==/original/CUOu1F.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h2>\r\n<p>After leaving college, a young student loses consciousness on his way home.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Upon waking, he finds himself in a strange and seemingly endless place, made up of empty corridors, abandoned rooms, and doors that appear to lead nowhere.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;With no idea how he got there, he must explore the area, solve puzzles, and find a way to escape.&nbsp;But something is watching. Something moves through the corridors as he tries to find the exit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The further he goes, the more the place begins to take on familiar characteristics, stirring up situations and memories from his college life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Perhaps this place is not just a place.</p>\r\n<h3><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTg2ODM4LmdpZg==/original/44KHwq.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<p><strong></strong>Tape B666: Elsewhere is a short first-person horror experience focused on:</p>\r\n<ul><li>&nbsp;Exploration</li><li>&nbsp;Puzzles&nbsp;</li><li>Atmosphere&nbsp;</li><li>Psychological horror&nbsp;</li><li>VHS aesthetic&nbsp;</li></ul>\r\n<p>The game was designed to be a short experience, lasting approximately 10–20 minutes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Can you find the way out?</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTg2OTYxLmdpZg==/original/QeRtER.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<h3>TAPE B666</h3>\r\n<p>New tape. New story. New nightmare.</p>\r\n<p>________________________________________________</p>\r\n<table><tbody><tr><td>Dubbing</td><td>Texts and Subtitles&nbsp; &nbsp;</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Portuguese</td><td>English</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>________________________________________________</strong></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><strong>If you have any questions, encounter bugs, or have constructive feedback, please contact us via email at: samukagomes.contato@gmail.com</strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg r